WEBVTT

00:13:59.941 --> 00:14:02.391
you'd be fighting
and scrambling to get to me.

00:14:03.424 --> 00:14:06.400
This, all this bad news, is preventable.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.451
That's the good news.

00:14:08.475 --> 00:14:10.451
It's very, very preventable.

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.916
So, let's just think about,
we got a problem here,

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.058
we need to reboot.

00:14:16.273 --> 00:14:18.916
Okay so, in my world,
what do we need to do?

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.655
Here is the thing, right,

00:14:20.679 --> 00:14:22.916
it cannot just come from one source.

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:26.347
To reboot and make real tangible change,

00:14:26.371 --> 00:14:29.315
real change, so that I could look you
in the white of the eyes

00:14:29.339 --> 00:14:30.916
and say, "In 10 years' time,